<title>THAILAND: TCJ Motor Q1 net rises slightly.</title>
<headline>TCJ Motor Q1 net rises slightly.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997			   1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		2.05			  2.05</p>
<p>    Net			51.27			 51.26</p>
<p>Notes: Results are reviewed. TCJ Motor Plc is an operator of heavy machine equipment.</p>
